  "description": "The Dovpo Ayce Mini 2 Pod Kit is an exceptional blend of style, performance, and simplicity, making it a standout choice for vapers who value portability without sacrificing functionality. Encased in a sleek zinc alloy and smooth borosilicate glass panels, this compact device is as durable as it is stylish. Equipped with a 1000mAh built-in battery, the Ayce Mini 2 offers a maximum power output of 30W, perfect for both mouth-to-lung (MTL) and restricted direct-to-lung (RDL) vaping styles. The advanced Zytek 2.0 mesh coil technology ensures leak-resistant performance while delivering enhanced flavour and vapour production. A top-fill design makes refilling the 2ml pod quick and mess-free, and the side adjustable airflow allows for a tailored vaping experience. With its interactive LED display and intuitive operation, the Ayce Mini 2 is designed for effortless usability. The compact and lightweight design makes it perfect for on-the-go vapers, while the compatibility with Zytek 2.0 mesh pods ensures a consistently satisfying experience. Whether you’re a new vaper or a seasoned pro, the Ayce Mini 2 Pod Kit is a stylish and reliable choice. Browse our vape juice flavours and enhance your vaping with this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
